Description: drop the legacy dllexport marker and complete the locale includes
 __declspec(dllexport) is a legacy macro the VOS headers do not define
 (the two instantiate/export sites failed to parse); ELF symbols are
 exported by default, so the specifier is simply removed. HustlerView.cpp
 also used B_TRANSLATE/B_TRANSLATION_CONTEXT without including
 <Catalog.h> or defining the context macro (relied on a transitive legacy
 include); add the include and the standard context definition.
Author: VitruvianOS Packagers <maintainers@v-os.dev>
Forwarded: no
Origin: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/Hustler
